      "title": "Playground tokens",
      "description": "Playground's tokens and their Tailwind theme: shadcn's semantic colours, the surface ramp, status, syntax, type, radius, layout, elevation, motion and the product utilities (frosted, gradient-stroke, brand-action). Import both files after tailwindcss.",
